== Trivia ==
*Like the [[Powder Ghast]], [[Golden Goblin]], or commission pick-up, the {{Mithril Powder|2500}} reward is affected by the [[2x Powder]] event.
*The floor of the '''Puzzler'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s room used to be made of [[Mithril Ore]], [[Stone]] and [[Iron Ore]], but it was changed as people used it to farm [[Golden Goblin|Golden Goblins]].

